LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Jeremy Pearce\, Federal Reserve Bank of New York\nHo
 sted by: Yueyuan Ma\n\nI am a Research Economist at the Federal Reserve 
 Bank of New York in Labor and Product Markets. I obtained my Ph.D. from 
 the University of Chicago. My main research is in macroeconomics\, with 
 an emphasis on firm dynamics\, productivity\, and economic growth. For m
 ore\, find my research page or my CV. Contact: jeremy.pearce@ny.frb.org\
 n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2026/macro-seminar-jeremy-pearce-fed
