SUMMARY:MACRO Seminar: Jane Olmstead-Rumsey\, London School of Economics
LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Jane Olmstead-Rumsey\, London School of Economics\nH
 osted by: Laura Murphy\n\nI am a macroeconomist with interests in firm d
 ynamics\, innovation\, labor markets\, and growth. I am an assistant pro
 fessor in the Economics department at the London School of Economics. I'
 m also an Associate of the Centre For Macroeconomics\, a Research Affili
 ate of the CEPR in International Finance and Macroeconomics\, and an aff
 iliated faculty with the Economic History department at LSE. I co-organi
 ze the Barcelona Summer Forum Growth and Productivity Workshop held each
  June. My Google Scholar page is here. Click here to view my CV.\n\nhttp
 s://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/macro-seminar-jane-olmstead-rumsey-lon
 don-school-economics
